1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,027
The admin is where your editors spend their day.

2
00:00:04,027 --> 00:00:08,119
One settings page changes how its menu, top bar, and lists look and

3
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:10,305
behave for everyone who signs in.

4
00:00:10,305 --> 00:00:13,500
Let's go through each option under Settings, Admin.

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,479
The options fall into three areas:

6
00:00:20,479 --> 00:00:25,000
the admin menu, the top bar and page headings, and the lists of items.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,520
They belong to the site, so they apply to everyone who uses its admin.

8
00:00:33,728 --> 00:00:37,290
Let's open Settings in the admin menu, and then Admin.

9
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:41,148
By default, only the Administrator role can open this page.

10
00:00:41,601 --> 00:00:44,272
Each option has a label and a short hint.

11
00:00:44,272 --> 00:00:50,241
Changes apply when you click Save, and a notification confirms that the site settings were updated.

12
00:00:54,444 --> 00:00:58,793
Enable Admin Menu filter puts a Filter box above the admin menu.

13
00:00:58,793 --> 00:01:02,894
Let's check it, along with Display New menu, and click Save.

14
00:01:03,353 --> 00:01:07,440
Typing in the Filter box hides every item that does not match, and

15
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:09,768
keeps the groups that hold a match.

16
00:01:09,768 --> 00:01:13,173
Typing Roles leaves Roles and the group that holds it.

17
00:01:13,631 --> 00:01:17,356
Display New menu adds a New entry at the top of the admin menu.

18
00:01:17,356 --> 00:01:21,297
It lists the content types that can be created, such as Article and

19
00:01:21,297 --> 00:01:25,131
Page, so an editor can create content from anywhere in the admin.

20
00:01:25,597 --> 00:01:29,921
Navigation menu behavior decides how the sections of the menu open.

21
00:01:29,921 --> 00:01:34,483
With Focused, only the section of the current page is open, and opening

22
00:01:34,483 --> 00:01:36,497
a section closes the others.

23
00:01:36,949 --> 00:01:41,802
With Persistent, sections stay open until you close them, from page to page,

24
00:01:41,802 --> 00:01:43,992
so several can be open at once.

25
00:01:43,992 --> 00:01:47,129
The section of the current page is always open.

26
00:01:51,324 --> 00:01:55,317
Enable quick navigation shows a magnifier in the top bar.

27
00:01:55,317 --> 00:01:58,993
It opens a palette of admin pages, also with Ctrl+K.

28
00:01:58,993 --> 00:02:03,304
Typing filters the pages, and Enter opens the highlighted one.

29
00:02:03,768 --> 00:02:08,797
Enable theme toggler adds a Toggle theme button, with Auto, Light, and Dark.

30
00:02:08,797 --> 00:02:12,478
Each person's choice is kept in that person's browser.

31
00:02:12,935 --> 00:02:16,694
Display titles in top bar moves the title of each page from the

32
00:02:16,694 --> 00:02:18,220
page into the top bar.

33
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:19,365
Let's check it.

34
00:02:19,822 --> 00:02:24,313
Show breadcrumb controls the trail of links above the title, which on pages

35
00:02:24,313 --> 00:02:27,751
such as the content editor leads back to Manage Content.

36
00:02:27,751 --> 00:02:29,802
Let's clear it, and click Save.

37
00:02:33,996 --> 00:02:38,326
List layout sets how lists such as Content Items show their rows:

38
00:02:38,326 --> 00:02:41,192
Use configuration default, List, or Grid.

39
00:02:41,192 --> 00:02:42,656
Let's choose Grid.

40
00:02:43,115 --> 00:02:45,772
Actions layout sets how actions appear:

41
00:02:45,772 --> 00:02:48,488
as Buttons, or in a single compact Menu.

42
00:02:48,488 --> 00:02:52,740
It covers the actions of each row and the secondary actions in the

43
00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:54,983
bottom action bar of edit pages.

44
00:02:54,983 --> 00:02:57,345
Let's choose Menu, and click Save.

45
00:02:57,808 --> 00:03:02,641
Content Items shows a column for Title, Type, Status, and Last modified, and

46
00:03:02,641 --> 00:03:06,235
the actions of each row sit behind one ellipsis button.

47
00:03:06,235 --> 00:03:08,298
Let's open the menu of a row.

48
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:13,949
Let users choose the layout of a list adds List and Grid buttons above the rows.

49
00:03:13,949 --> 00:03:17,629
The choice is kept for that list, for that person only.

50
00:03:17,629 --> 00:03:21,430
Clear the option, and every list follows the site layout.

51
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:26,336
That covers the options on the admin settings page.

52
00:03:26,336 --> 00:03:29,955
Together, they shape the menu, the top bar, and the lists for the

53
00:03:29,955 --> 00:03:32,045
people who use the admin every day.

54
00:03:32,045 --> 00:03:33,370
Thanks for watching.

